+## Overview
+
+Sales covered 30 orders placed between 2026-05-02 and 2026-05-21, generating total revenue of $7,154.44. The median order value was $204.94. Four products (Gadget, Widget, Doohickey, Sprocket) sold across four regions: North, East, South, and West.
+
+## Top Products
+
+Gadget leads with $2,392.00 in revenue from only 7 orders and 16 units, reflecting its $149.50 unit price. Widget follows at $2,118.94 on high volume: 106 units across 10 orders. Doohickey earned $1,513.00 and Sprocket $1,130.50.
+
+## Regional Performance
+
+North is the strongest region at $2,176.35 across 8 orders, with the highest average order value ($272.04). East follows at $1,830.79 from 7 orders, then South at $1,732.48 from 8 orders. West trails at $1,414.82 from 7 orders, with the lowest average order ($202.12).
+
+## Recommendations
+
+- Prioritize Gadget sales: it produced $2,392.00, the highest product revenue, from just 16 units; small unit gains add revenue quickly.
+- Investigate the West region, which generated only $1,414.82, roughly 35% below North, despite a comparable order count.
+- Grow Widget volume; its 106 units across 10 orders show steady demand at a low price point worth bundling.
